https://github.com/JBurkinshaw/crossing-map

The terms of each source are listed per layer in data/README.md, and each
feature's `source_licence` property states the licence of its source.

Layers derived from the Copernicus DEM GLO-30 (the mountain glyphs, and the
hachures, contours and Oblique archives among the tiles) are also subject to
the Copernicus DEM licence, and anyone who reuses them is bound by it too.
The notice and disclaimer it requires are in data/README.md.

Quotations from The Crossing (the Spanish incipits of a few words each) are
© Cormac McCarthy, used for commentary, and are not licensed here.
